  "description": "This package is part of Fabricator, an infrastructure automation framework. Fabricator.Console provides the command-line interface for Fabricator, including argument parsing, logging facilities, and orchestration of resource deployment execution. It processes the resources and manages the apply/check workflow lifecycle.",
